# REST Client examples. Set token to the deployed FASTAPI_BEARER_TOKEN.
# File includes are relative to this .http file in examples/.
# Syntax: https://github.com/Huachao/vscode-restclient#request-body
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:7770
@token = replace-with-your-token
@taskId = replace-with-returned-task-id

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Synchronous parse: switches are query parameters, tier is a form field.
POST {{baseUrl}}/mineru?chunk_type=true&return_txt=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=mineru-example

--mineru-example
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="tier"

advanced
--mineru-example
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="p2.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ../input/p2.pdf
--mineru-example--

### Ordinary task: requires deploy/pm2/ecosystem.celery.json worker.
POST {{baseUrl}}/mineru/task?chunk_type=true&return_txt=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=mineru-example

--mineru-example
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="tier"

advanced
--mineru-example
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="priority"

normal
--mineru-example
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="p2.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ../input/p2.pdf
--mineru-example--

### Ordinary task result
GET {{baseUrl}}/mineru/task/{{taskId}}?pretty=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Two-stage: all switches are form fields.
POST {{baseUrl}}/two_stage/task
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=mineru-example

--mineru-example
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="tier"

advanced
--mineru-example
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="chunk_type"

true
--mineru-example
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="return_txt"

true
--mineru-example
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="p2.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ../input/p2.pdf
--mineru-example--

### Two-stage result
GET {{baseUrl}}/two_stage/task/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Two-stage ready/unacked queue counts
GET {{baseUrl}}/two_stage/queue_status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
